{"4470800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solo Raid: Mage", "steam_appid": 4470800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo Raid: Mage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Raid: Mage is a single player dungeon crawler inspired by classic MMORPG combat, rebuilt as a roguelite experience.  Master deliberate spell casting, craft powerful builds, and defeat dangerous dungeon bosses, entirely solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo available now, wishlist to follow development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic MMO Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage cooldowns, interrupt enemies, and position carefully as you fight through dungeons.  Resource management, crowd control, line of sight, and more crucial raid techniques are part of every dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Defines Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful dungeon bosses test your single target damage and preparation, where dungeon rooms test your area of effect and ability to kite in a contained zone.  Learn enemy mechanics, adapt your strategy, and defeat them in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means your character dies, and all progress on that character is lost... But that characters gold remains.  Use gold to unlock permanent abilities and talents that you guarantee your next character will get.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the <strong>free demo</strong> and experience the core combat and build system.  The demo features the first raid.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo Raid: Mage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Raid: Mage is a single player dungeon crawler inspired by classic MMORPG combat, rebuilt as a roguelite experience.  Master deliberate spell casting, craft powerful builds, and defeat dangerous dungeon bosses, entirely solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo available now, wishlist to follow development!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic MMO Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage cooldowns, interrupt enemies, and position carefully as you fight through dungeons.  Resource management, crowd control, line of sight, and more crucial raid techniques are part of every dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Defines Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful dungeon bosses test your single target damage and preparation, where dungeon rooms test your area of effect and ability to kite in a contained zone.  Learn enemy mechanics, adapt your strategy, and defeat them in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roguelite Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death means your character dies, and all progress on that character is lost... But that characters gold remains.  Use gold to unlock permanent abilities and talents that you guarantee your next character will get.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the <strong>free demo</strong> and experience the core combat and build system.  The demo features the first raid.</p>", "short_description": "A single-player dungeon experience built for fans of classic MMORPG combat. Solo Raid: Mage recreates the deliberate pacing, cooldown management, and rotational mastery of old-school raiding — layered with roguelite build progression. Each attempt is a new build, that you must learn to wield.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4470800/59d594e4d77270f5da11aa1693a9d982ec5a5365/header.jpg?t=1773105128", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akam